"In most cases at least some of the following parameters will need to be "
"changed:"
msgstr "大多数情况下，至少需要更改以下部分参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:70
#: ../../source/docs/common-am32-escs.rst:72 49234766b53e438fbf07252b16dabb92
#: ee491e34205244ac950f1d6d98359f5c f4e55f1ab0fd4f3a81e35593784c500f
